# =============================================================================
# Docker build context hygiene
# Keep the build context focused on the files needed to build the application
# image. Smaller contexts are faster to send to Docker and easier to reason
# about when cache invalidation happens.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git and local editor state
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local agent / helper metadata
# These files help humans and tools in the repo, but the application image
# does not need them.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ai
.amazonq
.claude
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local overrides
# Runtime configuration is injected through environment variables, not copied
# into the image build context.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
local.env

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build outputs, logs, and test sources
# The image build compiles from source; it should not copy previous outputs.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
target
logs
*.log
src/test

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository content not needed for the runtime image
# Keep Docker-related files themselves out of the build context too: the daemon
# already has the active Dockerfile, and Compose files are not used by `mvn`.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Maven release/plugin leftovers
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/pom.xml.versionsBackup
**/pom.xml.tag
**/pom.xml.releaseBackup
**/pom.xml.next
**/pom.xml.backup
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
